        "original_id": "f6070de4-d4ce-52f5-be76-5d50b3ec5c74",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christoph Martin Wieland, Carl Maria von Weber, Maxine Peake, Matt Lucas, John Hannah, Nonso Anozie\n- Works: Geschichte des Agathon, Oberon, A Midsummer Night's Dream (2016 film), Oberon\n- Concepts: Bildungsroman\n- Characters: Oberon, Titania, Bottom, Theseus\n- Topics: medieval literature, Renaissance literature, opera\n\nFacts:\n- Christoph Martin Wieland is best remembered for writing the first Bildungsroman, \"Geschichte des Agathon.\"\n- Christoph Martin Wieland also wrote the epic \"Oberon.\"\n- Carl Maria von Weber's opera of the same name was based on Christoph Martin Wieland's epic \"Oberon.\"\n- In medieval and Renaissance literature, Oberon is a king of the fairies.\n- The 2016 film \"A Midsummer Night's Dream\" stars Maxine Peake as Titania, Matt Lucas as Bottom, John Hannah as Theseus, and Nonso Anozie as Oberon.",
